|game_text=Plays on table. Scanning Crew is canceled. If an ‘insert’ card was just inserted or revealed, it is canceled. You lose no Force to Boonta Eve Podrace. While you occupy three battlegrounds, Watto's Box is suspended.
|errata_history=This is the original printing: the earliest PC card image of this card (8 July 2018). It is not the current version; the current version is [[Your Insight Serves You Well (Reflections III) (V) (Errata 2)]] (PC-E2). The image is the PC card image of this version.
* '''Original''' (this page): PC card image of 8 July 2018<ref name="ht-L_yourinsightservesyouwell-0">PC card image in the PC's Holotable image set: [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/blob/022435b/Images-HT/starwars/ResetDS-Light/large/yourinsightservesyouwell.gif yourinsightservesyouwell.gif], commit [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/commit/022435b 022435b] (8 July 2018, “Set 9 load”).</ref>, no errata mark; lower-left name “•Your Insight Serves You Well”. The PC first released this shield with [[Virtual Set 0]] / [[Virtual Set D]] on 24 September 2014. The PC's Holotable image set starts on 8 July 2018, so this is the earliest surviving PC card image; whether the 2014 release slip had the same words is not shown by it. Text: “Plays on table. Scanning Crew is canceled. If an ‘insert’ card was just inserted or revealed, it is canceled. You lose no Force to Boonta Eve Podrace. While you occupy three battlegrounds, Watto's Box is suspended.”
* '''PC-E1''' ([[Your Insight Serves You Well (Reflections III) (V) (Errata)]]): PC card image of 31 July 2022<ref name="ht-L_yourinsightservesyouwell-1">PC card image in the PC's Holotable image set: [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/blob/ab74419/Images-HT/starwars/ResetDS-Light/large/yourinsightservesyouwell.gif yourinsightservesyouwell.gif], commit [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/commit/ab74419 ab74419] (31 July 2022, “updated hires gifs”); high-resolution image <code>ResetDS-Light/hires/yourinsightservesyouwell.png</code>, commit [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/commit/594c3a0 594c3a0] (31 July 2022, “Set 0 Hi Res”).</ref>, no errata mark; lower-left name “Your Insight Serves You Well (Reflections III)”. What changed from the previous version: re-rendered by the PC in its high-resolution card style (new frame, colours and typesetting); same words (new line breaks). The lower-left name changes from “•Your Insight Serves You Well” to “Your Insight Serves You Well (Reflections III)”. No errata mark. The printed errata mark (none) does not match this version's place in the release order (change 1 of this card): recorded as a [[Players Committee transcription errors#Errata marks that do not match the version (Virtual Modern)|PC transcription error]]. Text: “Plays on table. Scanning Crew is canceled. If an ‘insert’ card was just inserted or revealed, it is canceled. You lose no Force to Boonta Eve Podrace. While you occupy three battlegrounds, Watto's Box is suspended.”
* '''PC-E2''' ([[Your Insight Serves You Well (Reflections III) (V) (Errata 2)]]): PC card image of 22 July 2024<ref name="ht-L_yourinsightservesyouwell-2">PC card image in the PC's Holotable image set: [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/blob/6c22b09/Images-HT/starwars/ResetDS-Light/large/yourinsightservesyouwell.gif yourinsightservesyouwell.gif], commit [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/commit/6c22b09 6c22b09] (22 July 2024, “Fixing case and making gifs”); high-resolution image <code>ResetDS-Light/hires/yourinsightservesyouwell.png</code>, commit [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/commit/a546b30 a546b30] (21 July 2024, “Set 23 Errata”).</ref>, marked “E1”; lower-left name “Your Insight Serves You Well (Reflections III)”. What changed from the previous version: PC errata released with [[Virtual Set 23]] and the July 2024 Defensive Shield Update Kit<ref name="dskit2024">Players Committee, [https://res.starwarsccg.org/virtual/DShieldUpdateKit_2024_July.pdf July 2024 Defensive Shield Update Kit] (PDF, 3 pages, “SWCCG Players Committee, July 2024”; file built 2 August 2024), released with [[Virtual Set 23]] (22 July 2024).</ref> (image marked “E1”): the whole game text after “Plays on table.” is replaced: “Cancels Scanning Crew and ‘insert’ cards just revealed. Sidious may not place Skywalkers out of play. Let Them Make The First Move may target only Undercover spies. Unless Inner Strength on table, opponent may use only one combat card per turn.” (the Boonta Eve Podrace and Watto's Box sentences are removed; the Sidious, Let Them Make The First Move and Inner Strength sentences are new). The printed errata mark (“E1”) does not match this version's place in the release order (change 2 of this card): recorded as a [[Players Committee transcription errors#Errata marks that do not match the version (Virtual Modern)|PC transcription error]]. Text: “Plays on table. Cancels Scanning Crew and ‘insert’ cards just revealed. Sidious may not place Skywalkers out of play. Let Them Make The First Move may target only Undercover spies. Unless Inner Strength on table, opponent may use only one combat card per turn.”
Versions follow Bill's rulings of 12 November 2026: every visible change on a PC card image is a version, numbered in release order; a printed errata mark that does not match that order is recorded as a PC transcription error.
